{"id":"n14439-2-8","stage":1,"title":"뛰어가다 · 跑过","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14439-2-8-1","ko":"바람이 많이 부네.","zh":"风真大啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"바람이","meaning":"风","explanation":"바람：风；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"바람","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85627","senseId":"1","lemma":"바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바람이","audio":"/audio/406cc056290e155abc22.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"부네.","meaning":"刮，吹","explanation":"불다：刮，吹；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"불다","audio":"/audio/1389fa35feb8849f522f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74179","senseId":"1","lemma":"불다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부네","audio":"/audio/733c49ce2bdf95aaae1a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9ec024bb0ceb6fd2","term":"바람","zh":"风","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3","entryId":"85627","definition":"气压的变化或者人类、机器等引起的空气的流动。","pronunciation":["바람"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"1389fa35feb8849f","term":"불다","zh":"刮，吹","audio":"/audio/1389fa35feb8849f522f.mp3","entryId":"74179","definition":"风起而向某个方向移动。","pronunciation":["불ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6fc9438b4c7937ea0e15.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14439-2-8-2","ko":"그래도 약속 시간에 늦지 않으려면 이 강풍 속을 뛰어가야 해.","zh":"不过为了不迟到，就算在这么大的风里也得跑过去。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래도","meaning":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","explanation":"그래도：“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36264","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}},{"text":"약속","meaning":"约定，约好，承诺","explanation":"약속：约定，约好，承诺","readings":[{"term":"약속","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36695","senseId":"1","lemma":"약속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약속","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3"}},{"text":"시간에","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"2","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간에","audio":"/audio/6e584c2e1ef26484da55.mp3"}},{"text":"늦지","meaning":"晚，迟到","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟到；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61181","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늦지","audio":"/audio/c015602a793539936328.mp3"}},{"text":"않으려면","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；으려면：表示实现意图所需的条件：“如果想要……”。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17186","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않으려면","audio":"/audio/49a9b37fb31639cab90f.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"강풍","meaning":"强风，大风","explanation":"강풍：强风，大风","readings":[{"term":"강풍","audio":"/audio/bc7eb69d72c08d65c520.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22738","senseId":"1","lemma":"강풍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"강풍","audio":